WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.553 --> 00:00:19.101
Zann was relieved when Perda rushed over and removed his Immobilization spell.

2
00:00:19.761 --> 00:00:24.103
He wanted to thank her, but he couldn't because the Muting spell was still in place.

3
00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:30.227
"We have to help Mellis," Perda said, ignoring Zira and her goons as they shouted for them to

4
00:00:30.287 --> 00:00:32.168
stop. Zann nodded.

5
00:00:32.768 --> 00:00:35.910
He turned and ran toward Mellis with Perda at his side.

6
00:00:36.691 --> 00:00:40.834
But when they got close to their friend, Zann realized she didn't need much help.

7
00:00:41.414 --> 00:00:45.317
Mellis had created a Shield spell, which was holding back the gorzogs.

8
00:00:46.017 --> 00:00:51.581
Zing flew overhead, occasionally sending out a blast of flame to singe the creatures' fur.

9
00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:55.583
"Stop or you'll be sorry!"

10
00:00:56.144 --> 00:00:56.844
Zira shrieked.

11
00:00:57.425 --> 00:00:58.525
Zann glanced back.

12
00:00:59.186 --> 00:01:02.088
Zira was gnashing her teeth and striding after them.

13
00:01:02.792 --> 00:01:06.654
Mellis zapped herself out of her shield bubble and joined him and Perda.

14
00:01:07.354 --> 00:01:09.455
Zann gulped as Zira pointed at them.

15
00:01:09.475 --> 00:01:13.777
"It was a mistake to defy me," she said.

16
00:01:13.797 --> 00:01:19.600
"Now I'm going to make an example of you in case anyone else is thinking of following in

17
00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.840
your footsteps."

18
00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:24.902
She paused to glare at Vilkor and the gathered crowd.

19
00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:29.324
Krub smirked and stepped up behind Zira, cracking his knuckles.

20
00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:36.587
Zann wasn't afraid of a fight, but he knew that sometimes it was better to flee.

21
00:01:37.287 --> 00:01:38.508
He grabbed the two girls.

22
00:01:38.528 --> 00:01:41.950
"Zap," he thought, doing his best to focus.

23
00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.072
The three of them landed at the base of the tree beside the well.

24
00:01:46.812 --> 00:01:48.093
Zann sighed with relief.

25
00:01:48.934 --> 00:01:51.655
His zap had been perfectly accurate for once!

26
00:01:52.475 --> 00:01:53.636
Perda looked confused.

27
00:01:54.096 --> 00:01:55.397
"Why did you zap us here?"

28
00:01:55.757 --> 00:01:56.238
she asked.

29
00:01:56.258 --> 00:02:00.340
"Oh. And I guess Zira's Shield spell isn't working anymore."

30
00:02:01.244 --> 00:02:02.664
Zann's eyes widened.

31
00:02:03.085 --> 00:02:04.345
He hadn't even thought of that!

32
00:02:05.165 --> 00:02:07.286
He was relieved that the shield was gone.

33
00:02:08.026 --> 00:02:10.507
Meanwhile Mellis pointed to her own mouth.

34
00:02:10.527 --> 00:02:12.707
"Oh, right," Perda said.

35
00:02:12.727 --> 00:02:15.088
"I almost forgot about the Muting spell."

36
00:02:15.928 --> 00:02:18.969
She quickly removed the spell from both Mellis and Zann.

37
00:02:18.989 --> 00:02:22.710
"Thanks," Zann said as soon as he could speak.

38
00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:24.350
"Listen, I have a plan.

39
00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:26.591
We have to go back through the time vortex."

40
00:02:27.351 --> 00:02:28.811
"What?" Mellis cried.

41
00:02:29.311 --> 00:02:30.932
But Perda immediately nodded.

42
00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:33.221
"Zann's right," she said to Mellis.

43
00:02:33.242 --> 00:02:35.263
"Zira is out to get you.

44
00:02:35.943 --> 00:02:41.307
The only way to keep you safe is to take you to our time, where she can't reach

45
00:02:41.347 --> 00:02:43.389
you." Mellis hesitated.

46
00:02:44.109 --> 00:02:47.792
Zann felt anxious as he listened to the shouts from outside the wall.

47
00:02:48.433 --> 00:02:50.354
How long would it take Zira to find them?

48
00:02:50.374 --> 00:02:52.536
"Hurry," he said.

49
00:02:52.556 --> 00:02:53.997
"Let's check the wormhole.

50
00:02:54.597 --> 00:02:57.980
If it works like the regular ones, there should be enough magic in the air to open it

51
00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:01.809
now." They joined hands and stepped closer to the tree.

52
00:03:02.349 --> 00:03:03.190
But nothing happened.

53
00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.450
"It was right here."

54
00:03:05.071 --> 00:03:06.771
Perda tapped the ground with her foot.

55
00:03:06.791 --> 00:03:08.292
"I know it was!"

56
00:03:09.032 --> 00:03:10.273
Zann's heart sank.

57
00:03:10.293 --> 00:03:11.993
"Are we trapped here?"

58
00:03:13.094 --> 00:03:14.434
Perda's shoulders slumped.

59
00:03:15.055 --> 00:03:16.415
But then she straightened up.

60
00:03:16.435 --> 00:03:21.397
"Wait. It didn't open the regular way back in our own time either.

61
00:03:22.017 --> 00:03:22.758
Remember, Zann?

62
00:03:23.338 --> 00:03:26.399
It opened when I grabbed that old metal leaf thing."

63
00:03:26.419 --> 00:03:27.980
"Metal leaf?"

64
00:03:28.448 --> 00:03:29.349
Mellis blurted out.

65
00:03:29.369 --> 00:03:31.570
"My pendant is shaped like a leaf."

66
00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:33.251
"Whoa, really?"

67
00:03:33.991 --> 00:03:35.352
Zann glanced at Perda.

68
00:03:35.832 --> 00:03:37.253
"Could it be the same leaf?"

69
00:03:37.273 --> 00:03:38.854
"I bet it is!"

70
00:03:39.514 --> 00:03:40.534
Perda looked excited.

71
00:03:40.555 --> 00:03:43.456
"That must be the key that opens this wormhole!

72
00:03:44.176 --> 00:03:47.718
After all, it's something from 'bygone days,' just like in the riddle."

73
00:03:47.738 --> 00:03:51.180
"But the pendant is back in our time," Zann said.

74
00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.701
"Does that mean we can't open the wormhole?"

75
00:03:54.282 --> 00:03:55.222
Perda shook her head.

76
00:03:55.242 --> 00:03:57.163
"There must be another way."

77
00:03:57.724 --> 00:04:01.086
Just then Zing flew over the wall, chirping irritably.

78
00:04:01.106 --> 00:04:02.868
"Get down here, little buddy!"

79
00:04:03.228 --> 00:04:03.848
Zann called.

80
00:04:04.309 --> 00:04:07.211
But someone else had seen Zing fly over the wall.

81
00:04:07.231 --> 00:04:08.512
"They're in there!"

82
00:04:08.872 --> 00:04:09.493
Krub shouted.

83
00:04:09.513 --> 00:04:11.434
"Inside, by the well!"

84
00:04:11.454 --> 00:04:13.536
"Should we zap away somewhere else?"

85
00:04:13.896 --> 00:04:14.537
Zann asked.

86
00:04:14.557 --> 00:04:18.100
"If we can get to the other wormhole, we could hide out in Wyssa's world."

87
00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:19.381
"No, wait."

88
00:04:20.001 --> 00:04:21.062
Perda looked thoughtful.

89
00:04:21.082 --> 00:04:25.686
"We don't have that key anymore, but maybe a different key would work.

90
00:04:26.406 --> 00:04:30.945
Something that survived through time, like Mellis' pendant or like that cup!"

91
00:04:30.965 --> 00:04:32.086
"What cup?"

92
00:04:32.506 --> 00:04:33.167
Zann asked.

93
00:04:33.807 --> 00:04:38.410
Perda quickly reminded him and Mellis about the cracked cup lying on the ground outside.

94
00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:43.913
"I'm pretty sure it's the same one that becomes a relic in our time," she said.

95
00:04:43.933 --> 00:04:46.194
"I saw it in your parents' lab."

96
00:04:46.894 --> 00:04:49.316
The three of them levitated to the top of the wall.

97
00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:50.656
Mellis pointed.

98
00:04:50.676 --> 00:04:51.737
"There it is!"

99
00:04:52.778 --> 00:04:53.818
Zann saw the cup.

100
00:04:54.579 --> 00:04:56.860
He also saw Zira rushing forward.

101
00:04:57.752 --> 00:04:59.534
"Stand back, everyone!"

102
00:04:59.954 --> 00:05:00.434
she cried.

103
00:05:01.055 --> 00:05:04.598
Magic energy crackled from her fingertips as she raised her arms.

104
00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:07.660
Zann created friction for a Shield spell.

105
00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:09.902
Beside him, Perda did the same.

106
00:05:10.522 --> 00:05:12.063
But Mellis acted faster.

107
00:05:12.504 --> 00:05:13.645
She raised both hands.

108
00:05:13.665 --> 00:05:21.577
"Away!" she cried, her voice amplified by a Swelling spell.

109
00:05:21.597 --> 00:05:27.660
A huge wave of energy swept out from Mellis, knocking Zira and her entourage off their feet and

110
00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.080
halfway to the horizon!

111
00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:33.782
"Wow!" Zann was amazed by Mellis' power.

112
00:05:33.802 --> 00:05:37.404
"Hurry." Perda was still rubbing her hands together.

113
00:05:37.424 --> 00:05:38.944
"She'll be back soon.

114
00:05:39.465 --> 00:05:43.926
And the gorzogs are still out there, so we'll have to bring the cup to us.

115
00:05:44.747 --> 00:05:47.528
Let's use a simple Transportation spell.

116
00:05:48.064 --> 00:05:49.045
Be sure to focus.

117
00:05:49.625 --> 00:05:53.208
We might have only one chance before Zira returns."

118
00:05:54.168 --> 00:05:57.611
Zann nodded, already rubbing his thumb against his other fingers.

119
00:05:58.251 --> 00:06:02.174
Transportation spells were basic magic, but that didn't mean they were easy.

120
00:06:02.955 --> 00:06:08.178
He thought back to the time he'd tried a Transportation spell in school and accidentally blew up the

121
00:06:08.218 --> 00:06:09.819
stuff he was supposed to transport.

122
00:06:09.839 --> 00:06:12.381
"Come to me," he murmured.

123
00:06:13.622 --> 00:06:15.944
The cup wiggled and then lifted off the ground.

124
00:06:16.584 --> 00:06:20.328
It floated toward the kids, finally landing in Zann's hand.

125
00:06:20.348 --> 00:06:21.789
"Got it!"

126
00:06:22.109 --> 00:06:22.530
he cried.

127
00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.692
He didn't bother to levitate down.

128
00:06:25.232 --> 00:06:29.296
Instead he released the spell and fell beside Zing with a grunt.

129
00:06:29.757 --> 00:06:31.158
Perda and Mellis did the same.

130
00:06:31.699 --> 00:06:34.802
With the cup in his hand, Zann stepped toward the tree.

131
00:06:35.322 --> 00:06:36.884
The wormhole swirled open!
